    "title_en": "Hello!",
    "title_zh": "你好！",
    "summary_zh": "打招呼、问候、道别和最常用的礼貌用语。学完后，你能在早上、下午和晚上用合适的方式和人打招呼，问对方好不好，并礼貌地道别。",
    "can_do": [
      {
        "id": "pre-a1.si.greet",
        "skill": "spoken_interaction",
        "en": "Can greet people and say goodbye with simple everyday expressions.",
        "zh": "能用简单的日常用语打招呼和道别。"
      },
      {
        "id": "pre-a1.si.how-are-you",
        "skill": "spoken_interaction",
        "en": "Can ask how someone is and reply in a very simple way.",
        "zh": "能问候对方近况，并用最简单的方式回答。"
      },
      {
        "id": "pre-a1.l.greetings",
        "skill": "listening",
        "en": "Can recognise greetings and polite expressions when people speak slowly and clearly.",
        "zh": "对方说得慢而清楚时，能听懂问候语和礼貌用语。"
      }
    ],
    "grammar_points": [
      {
        "id": "pre-a1.greetings-pattern",
        "title_en": "Greeting and replying",
        "title_zh": "打招呼和回应",
        "pattern": "Good + morning / afternoon / evening\nHow are you? — I'm + fine / good, thanks.",
        "explanation_zh": "英语打招呼常按时间选择：早上 Good morning，下午 Good afternoon，晚上见面 Good evening。Hi 和 Hello 什么时候都能用，Hi 更随意。别人问 How are you? 时，一般先简短回答，再说 thanks，常常再问一句 And you?",
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Good morning, Mr Lee.",
            "zh": "李先生，早上好。"
          },
          {
            "en": "Hi, Anna! How are you?",
            "zh": "嗨，安娜！你好吗？"
          },
          {
            "en": "I'm good, thanks. And you?",
            "zh": "我挺好的，谢谢。你呢？"
          }
        ],
        "common_errors": [
          {
            "wrong": "Good night! (晚上见面时)",
            "right": "Good evening!",
            "why_zh": "Good night 是晚上分别或睡前说的“晚安”，见面打招呼要说 Good evening。"
          },
          {
            "wrong": "You welcome.",
            "right": "You're welcome.",
            "why_zh": "You're 是 You are 的缩写，不能省掉。"
          },
          {
            "wrong": "Thanks you.",
            "right": "Thanks. / Thank you.",
            "why_zh": "Thanks 本身就是“谢谢”，后面不再加 you；或者说完整的 Thank you。"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
